## Install

```console
$ cargo install {{ name }}
```

Or without a package manager:

```console
$ curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{ repo }}/main/tools/install.sh | sh
```

```powershell
irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{ repo }}/main/tools/install.ps1 | iex
```

